5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I believe we should be thorough in our preparations. I would like to look into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A thorough start, Jonathan. I'll take a different approach. I want to see the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round. Let's see what the data actually tells us.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree that we need a balanced view. I'd like to look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review. It's important to know our current capacity.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to make sure we can actually handle whatever we add! I'll look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and also what the booking system records. Let's see if we have the space!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see everyone so eager to help. I shall look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries. I hope this will be useful for us.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we have covered a wide range of operational and financial areas. I am curious to see if our findings will align or reveal conflicting priorities. I will pass for now.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, alignment is rarely the goal of a truly critical analysis. I'm more interested in seeing where the gaps are. I'll skip the rest of this turn.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think it's wonderful that we're all looking at different angles. It will help us make a decision that is fair to everyone involved. I'll skip for now as well.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm just excited to see what's happening behind the scenes! I hope my findings help us pick something that doesn't make the hospital too crowded. I'll skip for now too!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to see such a spirited discussion. I believe your different perspectives will lead us to a very thoughtful decision. I shall also skip for now.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we have a comprehensive plan for our research. I will step back and wait for the results to be gathered.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
16,1,3,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I agree. There is no need for further chatter until the facts are in front of us. I'll wait for the data to reveal the truth.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
18,1,3,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with you both. I'm looking forward to seeing what we all discover and how we can best support the staff.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
20,1,3,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
21,1,3,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I can't wait to see if we have enough room for a cool new program. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
22,1,3,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us all take a little rest and wait for the information to arrive. I look forward to hearing what you all find.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
